{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Inspired by Shin Megami Tensei Online: Imagine, Dark Cloud, A Link to the Past. </i><br><i></i><br><i>The Moon Goddess... seemingly distraught, tears apart a barrier between worlds, causing planes to appear in different dimensions and realities entirely - while doing so she unleashes her Celestial Beings, causing the human plane to further mutate as magik from wilted realms seep into Midgard. The world today.. now exists as a cohesion between a new kind of normalcy - willfully forged, and post-apocalyptic dead-zones that humans have foregone due to strong manifestations of Celestial Magik...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>From time to time, Towers seem to appear out of nowhere.. those who wander into them are usually never seen or heard of again...these spaces have come to be known as Dungeons.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dungeons, are typically only tested and tried by those known as &quot; Scavengers&quot; , &quot;Wasties&quot;, or what the Goddess may deem them herself...</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;Moonlit Vassals.&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614050/extras/12b53da2700303f42d87dffc3d42d8f3.poster.avif?t=1750803299\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614050/extras/12b53da2700303f42d87dffc3d42d8f3.webm?t=1750803299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614050/extras/12b53da2700303f42d87dffc3d42d8f3.mp4?t=1750803299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resource Gathering</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect materials (wood, stone, food) from the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614050/extras/8959008fc69e7c1726803e4315558521.avif?t=1750803299\" width=598 height=602 /></span></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting System</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine resources to create tools, weapons, and shelter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614050/extras/4851cf1cf4ca067f1893ca232289a693.avif?t=1750803299\" width=754 height=370 /></span></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Health System +\u00a0Hunger and Thirst Management</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage injuries, illnesses, and overall health status.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor and maintain character\u2019s nutrition and hydration levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614050/extras/da206dd505f9272dca91186728c1cabd.avif?t=1750803299\" width=790 height=626 /></span></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weather and Environmental Effects</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to changing weather conditions (rain, snow) and temperature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614050/extras/0bc523da7c44a2e5d26636e54d56e555.avif?t=1750803299\" width=606 height=304 /></span></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Base Building</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct and upgrade shelters to protect against threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614050/extras/798a67e3700091a32158769fe535794b.avif?t=1750803299\" width=800 height=386 /></span></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in combat against enemies and wildlife.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614050/extras/45d3a2c1fae61f1c70a77fb7ec2ffca5.avif?t=1750803299\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614050/extras_big/45d3a2c1fae61f1c70a77fb7ec2ffca5.avif?t=1750803299 width=800 height=418 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Foraging and Farming</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather wild plants or cultivate crops for sustainable food sources.</p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614050/extras/264c222f06bee06ca3070698f8a9a104.poster.avif?t=1750803299\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614050/extras/264c222f06bee06ca3070698f8a9a104.webm?t=1750803299\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614050/extras/264c222f06bee06ca3070698f8a9a104.mp4?t=1750803299\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day/Night Cycle</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plan activities around a dynamic time system that affects gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614050/extras/7a94e54dc7133613122545848b9620aa.avif?t=1750803299\" width=688 height=332 /></span></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Partner System: Contracting</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seek out a partner of your choosing and attempt to contract with them to make them an ally, then level up along-side your partner and fight together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Customization</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tailor skills, appearance, and traits to suit different survival strategies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614050/extras/78da511d48ce358bd27b1e43e589d4e7.avif?t=1750803299\" width=560 height=352 /></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local Saving</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player data is saved locally, your character is yours. Keep your character and items when switching worlds.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614050/extras/e554318bc263ec530a17cbae1b153cfc.avif?t=1750803299\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614050/extras_big/e554318bc263ec530a17cbae1b153cfc.avif?t=1750803299 width=800 height=422 /></span></p></li></ul></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stat Allocation</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will gain stat points as they level up that they can then distribute to grow stronger in the Wasteland.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614050/extras/4bea37b7ec0915acfceec9a6867d6253.avif?t=1750803299\" width=536 height=702 /></span></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skills</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon meeting stat requirements, or discovering out in the Wasteland, players will be able to garner a roster of skills that they may then use to assist themelves and other wasties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614050/extras/053e4b7c4a33fb7b912188670f1d70a1.avif?t=1750803299\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614050/extras_big/053e4b7c4a33fb7b912188670f1d70a1.avif?t=1750803299 width=800 height=350 /></span></p></li></ul></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >With friends the burden is lightened, gather your comrades and re-build the world together! ( NPC)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614050/extras/82977fd301f844911e954883168fc48c.avif?t=1750803299\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614050/extras_big/82977fd301f844911e954883168fc48c.avif?t=1750803299 width=800 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614050/extras/c641d9025174f8c787a949a0b1a0cde7.avif?t=1750803299\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614050/extras_big/c641d9025174f8c787a949a0b1a0cde7.avif?t=1750803299 width=800 height=476 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.st