4851cf1cf4ca067f1893ca232289a693.avif?t=1750803299\" width=754 height=370 /></span></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Health System +\u00a0Hunger and Thirst Management</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage injuries, illnesses, and overall health status.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor and maintain character\u2019s nutrition and hydration levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614050/extras/da206dd505f9272dca91186728c1cabd.avif?t=1750803299\" width=790 height=626 /></span></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weather and Environmental Effects</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to changing weather conditions (rain, snow) and temperature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614050/extras/0bc523da7c44a2e5d26636e54d56e555.avif?t=1750803299\" width=606 height=304 /></span></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Base Building</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct and upgrade shelters to protect against threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614050/extras/798a67e3700091a32158769fe535794b.avif?t=1750803299\" width=800 height=386 /></span></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in combat against enemies and wildlife.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614050/extras/45d3a2c1fae61f1c70a77fb7ec2ffca5.avif?t=1750803299\" data-big-sr