ng>Character Customization</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tailor skills, appearance, and traits to suit different survival strategies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614050/extras/78da511d48ce358bd27b1e43e589d4e7.avif?t=1750803299\" width=560 height=352 /></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local Saving</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player data is saved locally, your character is yours. Keep your character and items when switching worlds.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614050/extras/e554318bc263ec530a17cbae1b153cfc.avif?t=1750803299\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614050/extras_big/e554318bc263ec530a17cbae1b153cfc.avif?t=1750803299 width=800 height=422 /></span></p></li></ul></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stat Allocation</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will gain stat points as they level up that they can then distribute to grow stronger in the Wasteland.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614050/extras/4bea37b7ec0915acfceec9a6867d6253.avif?t=1750803299\" width=536 height=702 /></span></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skills</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upon meeting stat requirements, or discovering out in the Wasteland, players will be able to garner a roster of skills that they may then use to assist themelves and other wasties.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614050/extras/053e4b7c4a33fb7b912188670f1d70a1.avif?t=1750803299\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614050/extras_big/053e4b7c4a33fb7b912188670f1d70a1.avif?t=1750803299 width=800 height=350 /></span></p></li></ul></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >With friends the burden is lightened, gather your comrades and re-build the world together! ( NPC)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614050/extras/82977fd301f844911e954883168fc48c.avif?t=1750803299\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614050/extras_big/82977fd301f844911e954883168fc48c.avif?t=1750803299 width=800 height=458 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614050/extras/c641d9025174f8c787a949a0b1a0cde7.avif?t=1750803299\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614050/extras_big/c641d9025174f8c787a949a0b1a0cde7.avif?t=1750803299 width=800 height=476 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614050/extras/eab0d0536f99caab34305503e21fd65b.avif?t=1750803299\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614050/extras_big/eab0d0536f99caab34305503e21fd65b.avif?t=1750803299 width=800 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Scav Moon"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i